ommunity.</span></span></span></h1>\n      <p class=\"lead measure\">The proposed Smart Sports Village is being designed around adaptable spaces for sport, education, innovation, inclusion and community use. Final configuration is subject to design development, approvals and partner requirements.</p>\n    </div>\n    <figure class=\"figure figure--16x10 figure--motion wipe\" data-video-scope><div class=\"pmedia\" data-parallax=\"0.08\"><img src=\"{{asset:img/life/cutaway.jpg}}\" alt=\"Concept rendering: a cutaway of the proposed dome at blue hour showing the floodlit pitch, running track, courts, a learning mezzanine and an esports studio, with crowds inside. Not an existing facility.\" width=\"1344\" height=\"752\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n      <figcaption class=\"caption-bar\">Conceptual Rendering — Not an Existing Facility</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"c69b847b","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"facilities.cards","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"77a9011d","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"band--cream\" data-el=\"facilities.cards\" data-el-build=\"custom-widget\">\n  <div class=\"wrap section\">\n    <div class=\"filter-row\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Filter facilities\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" data-fac-filter=\"all\" aria-pressed=\"true\">All spaces</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" data-fac-filter=\"sport\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Sport</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" data-fac-filter=\"performance\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Performance</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" data-fac-filter=\"learning\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Learning</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" data-fac-filter=\"inclusive\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Inclusive support</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" data-fac-filter=\"media\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Media</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip\" data-fac-filter=\"retail\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Retail &amp; food</button>\n    </div>\n    <p id=\"facility-count\" class=\"sr-only\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n    <div class=\"cards\" style=\"--min:320px;gap:24px\" data-stagger>\n      \n      <article class=\"cell facility-card\" data-group=\"sport\" style=\"border:1px solid var(--line);min-height:250px\">\n        <div class=\"cell__top\"><span class=\"num\">01</span><span class=\"pill pill--soft\">Availability coming soon</span></div>\n        <h2 class=\"h3\">Multi-Sport Dome</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin-bottom:auto\">Configurable fields and courts for soccer, cricket, basketball, sprint training and other activities.</p>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Capacity, amenities and accessibility details pending approval.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"cell facility-card\" data-group=\"performance\" style=\"border:1px solid var(--line);min-height:250px\">\n        <div class=\"cell__top\"><span class=\"num\">02</span><span class=\"pill pill--soft\">Availability coming soon</span></div>\n        <h2 class=\"h3\">Performance &amp; Recovery</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin-bottom:auto\">Strength, testing, biomechanics, analytics and recovery functions under development.</p>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Capacity, amenities and accessibility details pending approval.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"cell facility-card\" data-group=\"learning\" style=\"border:1px solid var(--line);min-height:250px\">\n        <div class=\"cell__top\"><span class=\"num\">03</span><span class=\"pill pill--soft\">Availability coming soon</span></div>\n        <h2 class=\"h3\">Learning &amp; Life Skills</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin-bottom:auto\">Tutoring, mentoring, workshops, academic support, meeting rooms and career readiness.</p>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Capacity, amenities and accessibility details pending approval.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"cell facility-card\" data-group=\"inclusive\" style=\"border:1px solid var(--line);min-height:250px\">\n        <div class=\"cell__top\"><span class=\"num\">04</span><span class=\"pill pill--soft\">Availability coming soon</span></div>\n        <h2 class=\"h3\">Inclusive Support</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin-bottom:auto\">Sensory-aware areas and flexible rooms for neurodivergent participants and inclusive service delivery.</p>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Capacity, amenities and accessibility details pending approval.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"cell facility-card\" data-group=\"media\" style=\"border:1px solid var(--line);min-height:250px\">\n        <div class=\"cell__top\"><span class=\"num\">05</span><span class=\"pill pill--soft\">Availability coming soon</span></div>\n        <h2 class=\"h3\">Esports, Media &amp; Broadcast</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin-bottom:auto\">Competition, production, podcast and storytelling spaces.</p>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Capacity, amenities and accessibility details pending approval.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"cell facility-card\" data-group=\"retail\" style=\"border:1px solid var(--line);min-height:250px\">\n        <div class=\"cell__top\"><span class=\"num\">06</span><span class=\"pill pill--soft\">Availability coming soon</span></div>\n        <h2 class=\"h3\">Retail, Food &amp; Partner Activation</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin-bottom:auto\">Marketplace, concessions, fan retail and activation zones.</p>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">Capacity, amenities and accessibility details pending approval.</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"d9194f93","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"facilities.form","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"75cd7c89","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"wrap section \" id=\"facility-updates\" data-el=\"facilities.form\" data-el-build=\"plugin\">\n  <div class=\"split split--form\">\n    <div class=\"form-intro reveal\">\n      <h2 class=\"h2\">Keep up to date on the facility.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-lg\">We will let you know as spaces, schedules and availability are confirmed.</p>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">Tell us only what helps us plan. Please do not include diagnoses, medical records or details about a child.</p>\n    </div>\n    \n<form class=\"form\" data-preview-form>\n  <p class=\"small muted\">Fields marked <span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color:var(--danger)\">*</span><span class=\"sr-only\">with an asterisk</span> are required.</p>\n  <div class=\"form__grid\">\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f14\">Name<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <input type=\"text\" id=\"f14\" name=\"name\" autocomplete=\"name\" aria-describedby=\"f14-err\" required aria-required=\"true\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f14-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f15\">Email<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <input type=\"email\" id=\"f15\" name=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" aria-describedby=\"f15-err\" required aria-required=\"true\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f15-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f16\">Phone <span class=\"opt\">(optional)</span></label>\n  <input type=\"tel\" id=\"f16\" name=\"phone\" autocomplete=\"tel\" aria-describedby=\"f16-err\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f16-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f17\">Organisation <span class=\"opt\">(optional)</span></label>\n  <input type=\"text\" id=\"f17\" name=\"organisation\" autocomplete=\"organization\" aria-describedby=\"f17-err\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f17-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f18\">Facility interest<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n  <select id=\"f18\" name=\"facility-interest\" aria-describedby=\"f18-err\" required aria-required=\"true\"><option value=\"\">Select a facility</option><option value=\"Multi-Sport Dome\">Multi-Sport Dome</option><option value=\"Performance &amp; Recovery\">Performance &amp; Recovery</option><option value=\"Learning &amp; Life Skills\">Learning &amp; Life Skills</option><option value=\"Inclusive Support\">Inclusive Support</option><option value=\"Esports, Media &amp; Broadcast\">Esports, Media &amp; Broadcast</option><option value=\"Retail, Food &amp; Partner Activation\">Retail, Food &amp; Partner Activation</option></select>\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f18-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f19\">Sport or intended use <span class=\"opt\">(optional)</span></label>\n  <input type=\"text\" id=\"f19\" name=\"sport-or-intended-use\" aria-describedby=\"f19-err\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f19-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f20\">Group size <span class=\"opt\">(optional)</span></label>\n  <input type=\"text\" id=\"f20\" name=\"group-size\" aria-describedby=\"f20-err\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f20-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f21\">Timeframe <span class=\"opt\">(optional)</span></label>\n  <input type=\"text\" id=\"f21\" name=\"timeframe\" aria-describedby=\"f21-err\">\n  \n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f21-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field field--full\">\n  <label class=\"field__label\" for=\"f22\">Accessibility needs <span class=\"opt\">(optional)</span></label>\n  <textarea id=\"f22\" name=\"accessibility-needs\" aria-describedby=\"f22-hint f22-err\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"\"></textarea>\n  <span class=\"field__hint\" id=\"f22-hint\">Tell us what would make a space work for you. No diagnosis or medical detail is needed.</span>\n  <span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f22-err\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span>\n</div></div>\n  <label class=\"check\" for=\"f13\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"f13\" name=\"consent\" required aria-describedby=\"f13-err\"><span>I agree to receive facility updates from AFSV VRC. You can unsubscribe at any time.<span class=\"field__error\" id=\"f13-err\"></span></span></label>\n  <div class=\"form-status\" role=\"status\" tabindex=\"-1\" hidden><strong>Thank you.</strong>Development preview — this form is not connected yet. Submissions will route once inventory and mailbox routing are confirmed.</div>\n  <div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn--navy\">Keep Up to Date<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></button></div>\n</form>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]}]}